===Etymology===
From {{derived|en|fr|didactique}}, from {{derived|en|grc|διδακτικός||skilled in teaching}}, from {{m|grc|διδακτός||taught, learnt}}, from {{m|grc|διδάσκω||I teach, educate}}.

